WEBVTT

01:30.440 --> 01:34.940
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.229 --> 01:37.870
[Episode 16]

01:46.120 --> 01:46.710
Tan'er.

01:51.350 --> 01:51.920
Tan'er?

02:01.400 --> 02:03.400
Didn't you want to find my true form?

02:03.640 --> 02:04.680
Here I am.

02:07.280 --> 02:08.500
I was confused.

02:08.800 --> 02:10.660
I have failed you, Immortal Lord.

02:11.020 --> 02:12.680
You certainly were confused.

02:28.620 --> 02:29.720
Miss Pianpian.

02:54.090 --> 02:55.210
Lu Pianpian.

02:55.750 --> 02:57.420
The murderer who killed your brother

02:57.420 --> 02:58.880
is right before your eyes.

03:06.090 --> 03:06.870
Back then,

03:07.560 --> 03:09.540
he used this demon-slaying blade

03:10.400 --> 03:12.600
to kill your brother with his own hands.

03:27.829 --> 03:29.760
I have wronged you, Immortal Lord.

03:31.000 --> 03:32.630
I willingly accept my death.

03:33.120 --> 03:35.380
I was the one who deceived Miss Pianpian.

03:36.120 --> 03:36.870
Dreamshard,

03:37.630 --> 03:39.990
even if you tear me into pieces

03:40.840 --> 03:41.800
and use me as fertilizer for your flowers,

03:41.800 --> 03:43.310
I won't resist.

03:44.750 --> 03:47.280
I only beg you to let Miss Pianpian go.

03:49.650 --> 03:50.490
Bingzhu,

03:51.030 --> 03:52.829
still so smooth with your words.

03:53.030 --> 03:55.030
Take these two to Biexin Courtyard.

03:55.630 --> 03:57.000
Let everyone see

03:57.710 --> 04:00.310
the consequences of
naively trusting humans.

04:08.760 --> 04:11.870
[Lovely and intelligent]

04:09.080 --> 04:10.610
If it weren't for a man,

04:11.290 --> 04:13.220
Pianpian could have enjoyed

04:13.630 --> 04:14.840
being second only to one

04:14.840 --> 04:16.769
and above all others in privilege.

04:17.480 --> 04:18.510
But she was blind,

04:19.360 --> 04:22.360
choosing to believe the sweet talk
of this Feiyu Guard

04:22.360 --> 04:25.000
and repaid Immortal Lord's kindness
with betrayal.

04:25.000 --> 04:26.860
Immortal Lord cared for Pianpian

04:27.100 --> 04:28.760
and gave her several chances.

04:29.270 --> 04:31.000
But she was bewitched by that wretched man

04:31.000 --> 04:33.159
and repeatedly tried
to harm Immortal Lord.

04:33.159 --> 04:33.870
In the end,

04:34.610 --> 04:35.740
this man

04:35.770 --> 04:38.020
turned out to be her brother's killer.

04:38.680 --> 04:41.350
Such people
who can't tell right from wrong

04:41.500 --> 04:43.560
don't deserve to become an immortal.

04:43.950 --> 04:44.740
Today,

04:45.000 --> 04:46.260
venomous insects will

04:46.350 --> 04:48.120
turn them into living corpses.

04:48.710 --> 04:51.310
They will stand in Biexin Court
forever after,

04:51.360 --> 04:52.830
as a warning to all.

05:02.630 --> 05:03.730
What's that?

05:04.360 --> 05:05.560
The venomous insect!

05:06.070 --> 05:07.270
The venomous insect.

05:15.000 --> 05:16.080
Master Bingzhu.

05:16.750 --> 05:19.210
Thank you for treating me
to delicious food.

05:19.720 --> 05:21.340
I had no choice either.

05:23.060 --> 05:25.380
I failed to protect all of you.

05:27.760 --> 05:28.490
Pianpian.

05:29.160 --> 05:30.360
At the brink of death,

05:31.340 --> 05:32.800
do you have any last words?

05:37.430 --> 05:39.830
I have followed Immortal Lord
for 16 years,

05:42.630 --> 05:45.190
and have long regarded her
as my only family.

05:45.950 --> 05:47.880
Every command from Immortal Lord,

05:47.950 --> 05:49.810
I have obeyed without exception.

05:49.960 --> 05:51.560
Luring people to the island,

05:51.970 --> 05:53.520
keeping those who submit,

05:53.950 --> 05:55.800
humiliating those who err,

05:57.040 --> 05:57.970
punishing them,

05:58.190 --> 05:59.190
and killing them.

05:59.620 --> 06:01.000
I also extract human essence…

06:01.000 --> 06:02.780
What is she talking about?

06:03.430 --> 06:05.030
Harm their physical bodies,

06:05.480 --> 06:06.880
and destroy their souls.

06:07.430 --> 06:09.560
Whatever Immortal Lord asked me to do,

06:11.070 --> 06:13.210
I never once refused.

06:13.800 --> 06:14.430
That can't be true.

06:14.430 --> 06:15.630
How is that possible?

06:16.290 --> 06:17.950
She must be talking nonsense.

06:18.750 --> 06:20.000
Immortal Lord isn't that kind of person.

06:20.000 --> 06:20.720
Exactly.

06:20.720 --> 06:21.430
It's impossible.

06:21.430 --> 06:22.160
Right.

06:22.630 --> 06:23.270
Pianpian,

06:24.270 --> 06:25.930
you brought this on yourself,

06:26.390 --> 06:28.190
yet how dare you
slander Immortal Lord here.

06:28.190 --> 06:30.630
I remember all the kindness
from Immortal Lord,

06:30.630 --> 06:32.050
but what I've done

06:33.740 --> 06:35.409
I can never forget.

06:36.000 --> 06:37.720
Every day, I'm tormented by inner conflict—

06:37.720 --> 06:39.380
the suffering is unbearable.

06:39.920 --> 06:41.720
So I can only punish myself.

06:42.270 --> 06:43.930
Only when my body hurts enough

06:44.270 --> 06:46.330
can my heart feel somewhat relieved.

06:47.870 --> 06:49.190
When the heart wavers,

06:50.000 --> 06:51.480
slander finds its way in.

06:52.159 --> 06:54.040
It's your own weak conviction

06:55.110 --> 06:57.370
that made you fall for a man's deception.

06:58.980 --> 07:00.370
I am useless.

07:03.250 --> 07:05.520
Following Immortal Lord every day,

07:06.750 --> 07:08.410
yet making no progress at all.

07:08.820 --> 07:11.400
Immortal Lord wishes to return
to the celestial mountain,

07:11.400 --> 07:12.620
but someone like me

07:13.070 --> 07:14.930
is of no benefit to Immortal Lord.

07:16.670 --> 07:18.700
But my life was given by Immortal Lord.

07:17.840 --> 07:21.710
[Lovely and intelligent]

07:19.920 --> 07:21.000
Now,

07:22.350 --> 07:23.810
I'm willing to give my life

07:24.620 --> 07:25.890
back to Immortal Lord.

07:30.900 --> 07:31.720
What is she trying to do?

07:31.720 --> 07:32.920
Release Lu Pianpian!

07:39.420 --> 07:41.780
Still acting like you're deeply devoted?

07:45.670 --> 07:48.000
As long as you release Lu Pianpian,

07:50.750 --> 07:52.480
I'm willing to help Dreamshard

07:54.050 --> 07:56.510
collect
the fragments of the Kunlun Mirror.

08:09.510 --> 08:10.360
Miss Zhirui.

08:10.460 --> 08:14.150
[Lovely and intelligent]

08:12.160 --> 08:14.220
Has Immortal Lord given any response

08:14.330 --> 08:16.590
about when Hong Ye will be returned to me?

08:16.800 --> 08:17.680
Immortal Lord

08:18.360 --> 08:21.190
is not someone you can
negotiate with as you please.

08:21.190 --> 08:23.850
Then what will it take
for you to release Hong Ye?

08:24.270 --> 08:25.560
You should think about

08:26.270 --> 08:27.600
what else you can do.

08:29.750 --> 08:30.270
Fine.

08:31.070 --> 08:32.580
If you are willing to release Hong Ye,

08:32.580 --> 08:34.049
I am willing to join Master Bingzhu

08:34.049 --> 08:37.049
in seeking the fragments
of the Kunlun Mirror for you.

08:44.270 --> 08:45.200
Both of you,

08:45.310 --> 08:46.910
follow me to Linghua Palace.

08:49.800 --> 08:52.520
You two think you can find
the Kunlun Mirror?

08:53.810 --> 08:54.450
Yes,

08:55.330 --> 08:56.440
the two of us can.

08:57.820 --> 09:00.030
If we can truly recover
the mirror fragment,

09:00.030 --> 09:01.480
you must release Tan'er

09:02.910 --> 09:04.270
and Miss Pianpian.

09:06.300 --> 09:08.500
Where do you plan to start looking from?

09:08.600 --> 09:09.800
With determination,

09:09.870 --> 09:11.270
even stones can be split.

09:11.720 --> 09:12.360
Besides,

09:12.550 --> 09:14.960
Immortal Lord will surely
give us some clues,

09:14.960 --> 09:15.560
won't you?

09:16.630 --> 09:18.440
Then I shall give you one clue.

09:20.080 --> 09:21.290
Mount Qiansui.

09:25.620 --> 09:28.220
There's a legend
in both human and demon realms

09:28.310 --> 09:31.630
that a fragment of the Kunlun Mirror
is hidden in Mount Qiansui.

09:31.630 --> 09:34.390
But it's guarded by Taotie,
the extremely ferocious ancient beast.

09:34.390 --> 09:35.870
Neither humans nor demons

09:36.050 --> 09:37.200
can approach it.

09:37.510 --> 09:40.240
The lucky ones get injured,
the unlucky ones die.

09:54.480 --> 09:55.130
Hong Ye.

09:55.600 --> 09:56.560
Wait for me.

09:57.140 --> 09:59.000
I promise I'll get you out of here.

10:15.840 --> 10:16.500
Be careful!

10:22.820 --> 10:23.880
What is this thing?

10:26.840 --> 10:28.170
It's a spirit herb

10:28.200 --> 10:30.200
that I brought from Demons' Valley.

10:30.270 --> 10:31.030
Perhaps

10:31.120 --> 10:33.020
it hasn't been watered for a while
and is throwing a tantrum.

10:33.020 --> 10:34.080
I'll be right back.

10:44.260 --> 10:45.200
Are you a dog?

10:45.200 --> 10:46.260
Why did you bite me?

10:46.440 --> 10:46.840
I...

10:47.440 --> 10:48.750
What are you trying to prove?

10:48.750 --> 10:50.750
Do you think Mount Qiansui
is a place for ordinary people?

10:50.750 --> 10:52.510
You wouldn't even fill
the gaps in Taotie's teeth.

10:52.510 --> 10:54.330
There's a Demon Slayer here, isn't there?

10:54.330 --> 10:55.050
Him?

10:55.080 --> 10:56.200
He's even more dangerous.

10:56.200 --> 10:58.150
Dreamshard Immortal is truly wicked,

10:58.150 --> 11:00.240
sending you alone with a man.

11:00.240 --> 11:01.550
Are you jealous?

11:01.840 --> 11:02.360
I'm not.

11:03.070 --> 11:04.270
During this journey,

11:04.630 --> 11:05.630
when you're with him,

11:05.630 --> 11:07.150
you must be cautious at all times.

11:07.150 --> 11:07.960
Keep your distance

11:07.960 --> 11:09.760
and don't cross any boundaries.

11:09.840 --> 11:10.440
Go back.

11:11.790 --> 11:12.750
I'll tickle you!

11:21.320 --> 11:22.580
It had enough to drink.

11:26.630 --> 11:29.430
Immortal Lord let them leave the island
so easily.

11:29.440 --> 11:30.440
Does she really believe

11:30.440 --> 11:32.770
they can find the Kunlun Mirror fragment?

11:33.440 --> 11:34.700
Mount Qiansui

11:34.910 --> 11:36.150
is guarded by Taotie.

11:36.600 --> 11:37.870
Everyone knows that.

11:38.670 --> 11:40.730
Many have tried to find that fragment

11:41.200 --> 11:42.750
but never returned.

11:45.360 --> 11:46.780
You mean

11:47.320 --> 11:49.680
finding the mirror fragment
is just an excuse,

11:49.680 --> 11:51.600
but she's actually sending them
to their deaths?

11:51.600 --> 11:52.790
It takes Hong Ye

11:53.200 --> 11:54.870
to find the fragments.

11:55.440 --> 11:58.700
Master Bingzhu
and Xiao Yao are mere mortals.

11:59.030 --> 12:00.290
What use could they be?

12:01.670 --> 12:03.550
If they realize they're no match
for Taotie

12:03.550 --> 12:05.290
and flee as soon as they reach shore,

12:05.290 --> 12:07.220
wouldn't that be too easy for them?

12:07.860 --> 12:09.320
That would be even better.

12:09.930 --> 12:12.790
Isn't Hong Ye convinced
their love is unbreakable?

12:12.960 --> 12:15.890
Seeing his beloved run off
with another man

12:16.200 --> 12:18.260
is the only way he'll finally give up.

12:22.310 --> 12:25.120
Lu Pianpian is still waiting eagerly
in prison.

12:25.960 --> 12:27.000
Let her see

12:27.600 --> 12:28.600
how unreliable

12:29.010 --> 12:30.370
a man's promises can be.

12:32.870 --> 12:33.960
With no one at the helm,

12:33.960 --> 12:36.420
I wonder where the wind
will carry this boat.

12:37.320 --> 12:39.550
The wind comes from
the Realm of Mist and Void.

12:39.550 --> 12:41.950
It will naturally take us
to Mount Qiansui.

12:43.120 --> 12:44.520
Let me ask you something.

12:46.840 --> 12:48.900
Why did you kill Pianpian's brother?

12:57.200 --> 12:59.600
Lu Tong was severely poisoned
at that time.

13:00.310 --> 13:02.370
He had already lost all his humanity.

13:03.490 --> 13:04.850
I had no other choice.

13:06.030 --> 13:07.630
Then why didn't you tell her?

13:08.160 --> 13:09.960
She's suffered enough already.

13:10.570 --> 13:12.900
Knowing that would only add to her sorrow.

13:14.160 --> 13:15.400
Let her keep

13:15.790 --> 13:17.100
the memory of her heroic brother

13:17.100 --> 13:18.700
as something to hold onto.

13:19.390 --> 13:20.450
Isn't that better?

13:32.180 --> 13:33.980
We've arrived at Mount Qiansui.

13:37.510 --> 13:39.300
The quickest way
to find the mirror fragment

13:39.300 --> 13:40.850
is to find Taotie first.

13:43.780 --> 13:45.670
We need to be wary not just of demons,

13:45.670 --> 13:46.930
but also of this place.

13:54.420 --> 13:56.880
If you're ordinary villagers,
come out now!

13:57.330 --> 13:59.860
Otherwise, you'll all be
treated as bandits!

14:11.930 --> 14:12.580
Officer,

14:12.670 --> 14:13.670
forgive my poor eyesight.

14:13.670 --> 14:15.530
Please forgive my poor eyesight.

14:15.750 --> 14:16.550
But that arrow just now

14:16.550 --> 14:18.480
clearly came from that direction.

14:19.790 --> 14:20.270
Li!

14:20.670 --> 14:21.270
Come out now!

14:21.270 --> 14:23.130
The officer has already seen you.

14:23.340 --> 14:24.490
Hurry up.

14:28.070 --> 14:30.000
You shot those three arrows just now?

14:28.650 --> 14:31.720
[Li]

14:31.670 --> 14:32.030
Yes.

14:33.390 --> 14:34.720
Your archery is not bad.

14:39.110 --> 14:39.840
Officer,

14:39.840 --> 14:41.000
he failed to recognize you.

14:41.000 --> 14:43.440
You can't even tell officials
from bandits?

14:43.440 --> 14:44.360
Are you saying

14:45.240 --> 14:47.070
my Feiyu Guard uniform

14:47.200 --> 14:48.460
isn't obvious enough?

14:48.770 --> 14:49.750
No, no, Officer.

14:50.030 --> 14:51.480
I was blind!

14:51.480 --> 14:53.120
We truly have nothing left.

14:53.120 --> 14:54.440
Please spare us.

14:54.960 --> 14:56.870
The village has nothing left
to pay taxes with,

14:56.870 --> 14:57.550
Officer...

14:58.080 --> 14:59.740
I'm not here to collect taxes,

15:00.390 --> 15:01.990
only to exterminate demons.

15:04.110 --> 15:04.440
Good.

15:04.550 --> 15:05.150
Good.

15:05.670 --> 15:06.320
Thank you.

15:06.320 --> 15:10.380
-Thank you, Officer. Thank you, Officer.
-Do you know where the demon is?

15:11.390 --> 15:12.090
That demon

15:12.270 --> 15:14.630
was wreaking havoc
in our village just days ago.

15:14.630 --> 15:16.630
Many houses were destroyed by them.

15:19.720 --> 15:20.450
Lead the way.

15:21.550 --> 15:22.240
Here.

15:22.600 --> 15:23.550
I'll show you.

15:26.440 --> 15:28.770
Li, how many years
have you been an archer?

15:31.910 --> 15:33.510
Your draw strength is sufficient,

15:33.510 --> 15:35.440
but your rear elbow
isn't level when drawing,

15:35.440 --> 15:36.620
you release too quickly,

15:36.620 --> 15:38.080
so your accuracy suffers.

15:45.960 --> 15:47.150
Please don't blame him, Officer.

15:47.150 --> 15:48.990
Li is our village's best hunter.

15:49.080 --> 15:50.390
He wasn't always like this.

15:50.390 --> 15:52.810
Since his wife was devoured by Taotie,

15:52.910 --> 15:54.710
he's become somewhat deranged.

15:55.000 --> 15:56.050
Please don't hold it against him.

15:56.050 --> 15:56.850
That's right.

15:57.550 --> 15:58.910
Does Taotie appear often?

15:58.910 --> 15:59.390
Yes.

16:00.000 --> 16:01.720
Taotie has turned

16:01.720 --> 16:03.050
our village into ruins.

16:03.510 --> 16:04.570
It's terrifying.

16:04.840 --> 16:05.920
It has three heads, six arms,

16:05.920 --> 16:07.120
and huge bloody jaws.

16:07.240 --> 16:09.460
It can swallow

16:10.240 --> 16:11.360
a fully grown man whole.

16:11.360 --> 16:13.190
Yes, if you anger it,

16:13.390 --> 16:15.250
it breathes fire from its mouth.

16:15.360 --> 16:16.320
Wherever the flames touch,

16:16.320 --> 16:17.720
nothing grows again.

16:20.920 --> 16:21.450
Officer,

16:21.790 --> 16:23.250
our village is just ahead.

16:23.270 --> 16:23.800
Let's go.

16:23.910 --> 16:25.270
I'll show you around the village.

16:25.270 --> 16:25.870
Please.

16:27.000 --> 16:27.640
Let's go.

16:27.720 --> 16:28.720
It's terrifying.

16:29.510 --> 16:30.550
Our village

16:30.630 --> 16:32.290
is in terrible shape now.

16:37.840 --> 16:38.550
Officer,

16:38.750 --> 16:39.880
this is our village.

16:40.750 --> 16:41.510
Take a look.

16:42.080 --> 16:43.890
This is all Taotie's doing.

16:44.000 --> 16:45.790
This house belonged to Ding Laosan.

16:45.790 --> 16:47.790
His family of four couldn't escape.

16:49.440 --> 16:50.040
Officers,

16:50.240 --> 16:51.270
there's another one ahead.

16:51.270 --> 16:52.130
Let me show you.

16:53.000 --> 16:55.460
This monster terrorizes our village daily.

16:55.600 --> 16:56.320
You have no idea.

16:56.320 --> 16:57.750
The villagers are so frightened

16:57.750 --> 16:59.880
they barely dare to leave their homes.

17:28.000 --> 17:29.880
Ya, come to Grandma quickly.

17:38.350 --> 17:39.150
Tribe Leader,

17:39.310 --> 17:40.310
an official is here.

17:40.310 --> 17:41.310
Hurry, leader!

17:41.790 --> 17:44.030
Come welcome our distinguished guests.

17:44.030 --> 17:44.770
Sir.

17:46.680 --> 17:48.080
Greetings to both of you.

17:48.880 --> 17:50.440
Please come inside.

17:50.750 --> 17:51.750
This way, please.

17:52.990 --> 17:53.590
Please.

17:55.310 --> 17:56.000
Leader,

17:56.160 --> 17:58.440
Li just shot an arrow at them
at the village entrance.

17:58.440 --> 17:59.920
He probably made them angry.

17:59.720 --> 18:02.320
[Tribe Leader]

18:01.000 --> 18:01.480
Sheng,

18:02.000 --> 18:02.720
you two should go back.

18:02.720 --> 18:04.520
Alright, we'll head back first.

18:05.070 --> 18:05.890
Sir and Madam,

18:06.240 --> 18:07.030
please sit.

18:07.350 --> 18:08.010
Have a seat.

18:08.240 --> 18:09.090
No need to trouble yourself, Leader.

18:09.090 --> 18:10.350
It's no trouble at all.

18:10.510 --> 18:11.790
Let me pour you some tea.

18:11.790 --> 18:13.680
Sir, as you've seen on your way here,

18:13.680 --> 18:15.830
you must have noticed

18:15.830 --> 18:16.920
how our houses

18:16.920 --> 18:19.310
and lands are completely devastated.

18:20.070 --> 18:20.680
Moreover,

18:20.680 --> 18:23.590
the villagers never know
where their next meal will come from.

18:23.590 --> 18:25.680
They're constantly harmed by Taotie.

18:25.680 --> 18:26.440
Nowadays,

18:26.440 --> 18:28.640
whether farming or hunting,

18:28.750 --> 18:30.920
people must go in groups.

18:32.400 --> 18:34.160
I would like to ask for your forgiveness

18:34.160 --> 18:35.270
for the young men just now

18:35.270 --> 18:36.880
who have offended you.

18:37.550 --> 18:38.160
Leader,

18:38.160 --> 18:39.550
are the claw marks on the wall

18:39.550 --> 18:41.190
all left by Taotie?

18:41.920 --> 18:42.400
Yes,

18:42.960 --> 18:43.790
indeed.

18:46.960 --> 18:47.550
Leader,

18:49.030 --> 18:51.160
are there any other traces left by Taotie?

18:51.160 --> 18:52.090
Would you please

18:52.140 --> 18:53.160
show us?

18:53.270 --> 18:53.750
Yes.

18:54.380 --> 18:54.830
Well,

18:55.270 --> 18:55.790
Sir.

18:56.510 --> 18:56.880
No...

18:57.270 --> 18:58.880
No matter how skilled you are,

18:58.880 --> 19:01.210
you're still just one person alone.

19:01.320 --> 19:01.960
So—

19:04.000 --> 19:04.590
No, no.

19:05.160 --> 19:06.620
You're stronger than him.

19:06.920 --> 19:07.720
But

19:07.720 --> 19:10.240
there are only two of you.

19:10.240 --> 19:12.400
It's better to not disturb that monster.

19:12.400 --> 19:13.240
In the past,

19:13.350 --> 19:15.000
government troops came several times,

19:15.000 --> 19:18.200
-and they were scared away.
-They don't know how to catch demons.

19:18.200 --> 19:19.360
The two of us

19:19.400 --> 19:21.110
will not leave

19:21.130 --> 19:22.030
until we eliminate Taotie.

19:22.030 --> 19:22.490
Mm-hmm.

19:23.330 --> 19:25.730
I just want to see the traces
left by Taotie,

19:25.830 --> 19:27.830
yet you're making various excuses.

19:28.640 --> 19:29.970
Don't tell me you want me

19:31.270 --> 19:33.070
to send a tax collector instead.

19:36.510 --> 19:37.590
If that's the case,

19:38.030 --> 19:38.490
then...

19:39.270 --> 19:39.830
Sir,

19:40.330 --> 19:41.330
please follow me.

19:44.300 --> 19:44.820
Look.

19:46.310 --> 19:47.710
These large footprints.

19:51.960 --> 19:52.480
Look.

19:53.830 --> 19:55.090
Especially that wall.

20:00.440 --> 20:01.370
The handprints.

20:04.000 --> 20:04.740
Claw marks.

20:05.000 --> 20:06.480
Were all these left by Taotie?

20:06.480 --> 20:07.160
Yes, yes.

20:10.240 --> 20:11.100
This blood too?

20:11.600 --> 20:12.400
That's right.

20:14.070 --> 20:15.070
Taotie's blood?

20:15.730 --> 20:16.350
No,

20:16.680 --> 20:18.110
it's Wang Er's wife's.

20:24.510 --> 20:25.040
Xiao Yao.

20:28.270 --> 20:29.800
Told you it'd scare her off.

20:49.790 --> 20:51.650
What footprints and handprints?

20:51.680 --> 20:52.590
The paint too?

20:53.680 --> 20:54.790
You might fool others,

20:54.790 --> 20:55.550
but not me.

20:56.240 --> 20:58.400
I used to make a living from this.

20:59.510 --> 21:01.470
But this Taotie...

21:01.750 --> 21:03.640
did it ever really appear?

21:05.350 --> 21:07.640
Li, have you decided yet?

21:08.000 --> 21:10.200
Are you going to meet her or not?

21:10.750 --> 21:11.720
It'd be nice

21:11.790 --> 21:13.790
to have a girl marry in this village.

21:14.440 --> 21:17.240
Other families are lining up asking me
to arrange marriages—

21:17.240 --> 21:18.440
but look at you.

21:19.640 --> 21:21.840
If the girl hadn't taken a liking to you,

21:22.000 --> 21:24.660
I wouldn't even bother
wasting my breath on you.

21:26.350 --> 21:27.160
This boy...

21:27.160 --> 21:27.850
Tell them

21:27.960 --> 21:29.160
I already have a wife.

21:36.720 --> 21:38.780
[Zixiu]

21:36.830 --> 21:38.490
Are you playing hide and seek?

21:41.570 --> 21:42.590
I want to play too.

21:44.920 --> 21:47.030
If you don't play with me, I'll scream.

21:47.030 --> 21:48.400
Don't scream, don't scream.

21:48.400 --> 21:49.400
Let's play.

21:49.460 --> 21:50.860
I'll hide and you find me.

21:58.000 --> 21:58.830
What's this?

21:59.360 --> 22:01.620
They made Taotie into an archery target.

22:03.240 --> 22:04.550
This is Taotie?

22:04.680 --> 22:07.440
Actually,
Taotie doesn't look like this at all.

22:08.160 --> 22:09.020
You've seen it?

22:09.240 --> 22:09.700
Mm-hmm.

22:11.350 --> 22:12.350
Where did you see it?

22:12.350 --> 22:13.830
Play hide and seek with me first,

22:13.830 --> 22:14.890
then I'll tell you.

22:15.820 --> 22:17.750
Aren't I playing with you already?

22:18.790 --> 22:19.990
Then close your eyes.

22:20.070 --> 22:20.440
Okay.

22:23.030 --> 22:24.320
I'll count to five.

22:24.480 --> 22:25.830
After five, I'll open my eyes.

22:25.830 --> 22:26.550
Run quickly.

22:26.550 --> 22:27.440
Don't cheat.

22:27.790 --> 22:29.880
I won't cheat.
I play fair.

22:30.270 --> 22:31.310
One.

22:32.800 --> 22:33.640
Two.

22:34.720 --> 22:35.660
Three.

22:36.070 --> 22:36.680
Five.

22:39.020 --> 22:40.440
I'm coming to catch you!

22:41.160 --> 22:42.160
If I get you,

22:42.440 --> 22:44.570
you have to come back to my cave with me.

22:52.960 --> 22:53.960
Come find me!

22:58.070 --> 22:58.750
Come on!

23:00.440 --> 23:01.300
I'll catch you!

23:05.240 --> 23:06.170
Did it scare you?

23:06.180 --> 23:07.580
It scared you, didn't it?

23:21.160 --> 23:21.690
Xiao Yao.

23:22.030 --> 23:23.160
Why did you come so far?

23:23.160 --> 23:24.350
I couldn't find you anywhere.

23:24.350 --> 23:25.640
I thought something had happened to you.

23:25.640 --> 23:27.550
It's nothing.
I was just playing with this child.

23:27.550 --> 23:29.550
But I was startled by this painting.

23:29.960 --> 23:30.550
Zixiu.

23:31.110 --> 23:32.750
This isn't a place
you should be running around.

23:32.750 --> 23:33.750
Go home.

23:33.830 --> 23:35.200
I'm not done playing yet.

23:35.200 --> 23:35.790
Stop playing around.

23:35.790 --> 23:36.830
All you think about is playing.

23:36.830 --> 23:37.590
Let me tell you.

23:37.590 --> 23:39.640
If Taotie finds you,
it will cost you your life.

23:39.640 --> 23:40.930
But I still want to play!

23:40.930 --> 23:41.790
Go back. Go back.

23:41.790 --> 23:42.390
Back. Now.

23:47.960 --> 23:48.550
I found

23:48.880 --> 23:49.960
this child

23:50.110 --> 23:52.110
when I was hunting in the mountains.

23:52.200 --> 23:53.750
I searched for a long time

23:54.110 --> 23:55.840
but couldn't find his parents.

23:56.160 --> 23:58.020
They probably met with disaster.

23:58.970 --> 24:00.440
This child has had a hard life.

24:00.440 --> 24:01.880
So now

24:01.880 --> 24:03.510
we're letting him stay in the village,

24:03.510 --> 24:04.720
giving him food to eat.

24:04.720 --> 24:06.250
He just offended you, Miss.

24:06.350 --> 24:07.350
Please don't blame him.

24:07.350 --> 24:09.350
-No, no.
-Why is there an arrow hole?

24:09.750 --> 24:11.110
That was drawn by Li.

24:11.160 --> 24:12.510
He uses it as a target.

24:21.240 --> 24:22.300
It's getting late.

24:22.550 --> 24:24.410
We shan't disturb the villagers.

24:24.510 --> 24:26.200
We'll rest here tonight.

24:27.640 --> 24:28.100
Well...

24:28.400 --> 24:30.460
Shall I bring you a charcoal brazier?

24:30.480 --> 24:31.210
Yes, please.

24:40.590 --> 24:43.070
All the traces left by Taotie
in this village

24:43.270 --> 24:44.550
were done by a human.

24:45.160 --> 24:46.020
The footprints

24:46.440 --> 24:47.240
and claw marks

24:47.790 --> 24:49.520
are all created very shabbily.

24:49.960 --> 24:52.620
The blood stains
are the most ridiculous of all.

24:55.310 --> 24:56.270
I suspect

24:56.270 --> 24:58.440
they've never seen a Taotie before.

24:59.640 --> 25:00.900
The Baize Drawings say

25:00.960 --> 25:03.750
a Taotie has a sheep's body
with a human face.

25:03.880 --> 25:06.080
Its eyes are located under its armpits,

25:06.110 --> 25:08.110
completely different from this one.

25:08.110 --> 25:10.680
Regardless of whether this drawing
depicts the real Taotie,

25:10.680 --> 25:12.510
but from what Li did today,

25:12.510 --> 25:13.590
I can tell

25:15.130 --> 25:17.330
he must have seen the real demon before.

25:19.090 --> 25:19.710
By the way,

25:19.920 --> 25:20.920
that kid just now

25:21.200 --> 25:22.400
told me today

25:22.400 --> 25:23.550
he has seen Taotie before.

25:23.550 --> 25:24.030
Him?

25:24.480 --> 25:25.880
I don't know if it's true.

25:26.880 --> 25:27.790
Here's what we'll do.

25:27.790 --> 25:28.960
Tomorrow you go find Li,

25:28.960 --> 25:29.920
and I'll find that child.

25:29.920 --> 25:31.160
We'll investigate further.

25:31.160 --> 25:31.550
Sure.

25:31.720 --> 25:32.320
All right.

25:36.440 --> 25:36.970
Xiao Yao!

25:37.350 --> 25:37.920
What?

25:38.400 --> 25:40.270
I need to talk to you about something.

25:40.270 --> 25:42.750
He's a single man
and you're a single woman—

25:43.270 --> 25:44.200
it's inappropriate for you two

25:44.200 --> 25:46.530
to using the same room.

25:46.880 --> 25:47.480
And also,

25:48.000 --> 25:49.830
since you two got on the boat,

25:50.270 --> 25:51.200
this pretty boy—

25:51.310 --> 25:52.440
I've felt that

25:52.920 --> 25:54.920
he has ulterior motives toward you.

25:56.510 --> 25:57.780
Furthermore,

25:58.350 --> 25:59.030
I'd rather

25:59.790 --> 26:02.000
you stayed with Luoluo

26:02.000 --> 26:03.270
than him!

26:03.270 --> 26:03.960
Do you get it?

26:03.960 --> 26:05.110
Little mantis, watch your tongue.

26:05.110 --> 26:05.590
Shut up!

26:05.590 --> 26:06.920
Who are you calling little mantis?

26:06.920 --> 26:07.790
You shut up.

26:08.510 --> 26:10.600
What's wrong
with being in the same room as him?

26:10.600 --> 26:12.650
Are we doing anything shameful?

26:12.960 --> 26:14.240
We're discussing important matters.

26:14.240 --> 26:16.400
Yet you're projecting
your own indecent thoughts onto others.

26:16.400 --> 26:17.200
How dare you

26:17.200 --> 26:17.710
blabber on

26:17.710 --> 26:18.160
and on.

26:18.160 --> 26:19.270
Let me tell you,

26:19.310 --> 26:21.570
you two being together is unacceptable!

26:22.240 --> 26:23.770
You like Luoluo, don't you?

26:26.710 --> 26:28.370
I'll let you see him right now.

26:31.630 --> 26:32.810
Luoluo, right?

26:38.400 --> 26:39.240
Luoluo!

26:40.000 --> 26:41.530
Weren't you blabbering on?

26:44.440 --> 26:45.970
What? I can't hear you.

26:50.160 --> 26:50.790
Still can't hear you.

26:50.790 --> 26:51.830
Speak louder!

26:51.830 --> 26:53.480
Aren't you supposed to be tough?

26:53.480 --> 26:55.030
Aren't you tough?

27:01.270 --> 27:01.960
That's...

27:02.920 --> 27:03.960
well drawn.

27:04.240 --> 27:05.040
It's alright.

27:16.480 --> 27:17.140
Did it hurt?

27:17.310 --> 27:18.160
Get out!

27:43.550 --> 27:44.750
Taotie is here!

27:45.440 --> 27:46.590
Taotie is here!

27:47.110 --> 27:48.350
Taotie is here!

27:48.750 --> 27:49.750
Taotie is here!

27:51.720 --> 27:52.750
The demon is coming!

27:52.750 --> 27:53.580
Kill it!

27:53.680 --> 27:54.720
Kill it!

27:55.400 --> 27:56.960
Sir, are you alright?

27:57.830 --> 27:58.790
This Taotie

27:58.880 --> 27:59.920
took advantage of the dark

27:59.920 --> 28:01.000
and entered the village.

28:01.000 --> 28:03.110
It was spotted in front of Li's house.

28:03.200 --> 28:04.440
The villagers

28:04.550 --> 28:06.270
have some experience dealing with it.

28:06.270 --> 28:06.920
Right, right.

28:06.920 --> 28:07.750
It didn't hurt anyone.

28:07.750 --> 28:08.810
They drove it away.

28:09.090 --> 28:09.550
Drove it away.

28:09.550 --> 28:10.160
It ran off.

28:10.350 --> 28:11.350
You drove it away?

28:11.350 --> 28:12.070
Yes, yes.

28:12.070 --> 28:12.670
It's gone.

28:12.680 --> 28:13.280
It ran off.

28:16.110 --> 28:17.000
Well done.

28:17.160 --> 28:18.270
Let's press our advantage.

28:18.270 --> 28:19.270
Give me the blade.

28:19.630 --> 28:20.070
Sir,

28:20.270 --> 28:20.700
look,

28:20.800 --> 28:22.930
Li and the young men have already gone,

28:22.960 --> 28:24.200
so there's no need to trouble yourself.

28:24.200 --> 28:24.830
Right, right.

28:24.830 --> 28:25.390
Sheng,

28:25.640 --> 28:26.400
go check it out.

28:26.400 --> 28:27.110
Go, hurry.

28:27.440 --> 28:28.720
Quick, let's go.

28:29.510 --> 28:30.310
Sir and Madam,

28:31.110 --> 28:32.920
get some rest.

28:42.590 --> 28:43.110
So,

28:43.550 --> 28:44.810
does it look familiar?

28:46.960 --> 28:47.960
All too familiar.

29:02.920 --> 29:05.070
There's fresh blood
at the base of these scales,

29:05.070 --> 29:06.800
and the footprints are so even.

29:10.000 --> 29:12.400
This doesn't seem like a human pretending.

29:14.520 --> 29:16.000
It must be a demon at least.

29:20.880 --> 29:21.440
Li!

29:21.540 --> 29:22.110
They're back.

29:22.110 --> 29:22.510
You've returned.

29:22.510 --> 29:23.510
They're back.

29:25.680 --> 29:26.410
How did it go?

29:26.510 --> 29:27.770
Another night wasted.

29:30.030 --> 29:31.430
Still couldn't catch it.

29:32.590 --> 29:34.790
So you all encountered Taotie?

29:35.960 --> 29:37.030
Chased it all night,

29:37.030 --> 29:38.230
but it got away again.

29:38.830 --> 29:40.160
It's fine if it escaped,

29:40.160 --> 29:41.440
as long as everyone is safe.

29:41.440 --> 29:42.370
Have some water.

29:43.070 --> 29:43.550
Here.

29:45.350 --> 29:46.280
Are you alright?

29:46.550 --> 29:47.510
You went that way.

29:47.510 --> 29:48.110
Next time,

29:48.550 --> 29:50.880
we absolutely cannot let it escape again.

29:51.640 --> 29:52.160
Li,

29:53.830 --> 29:55.240
may I see your arrow?

30:03.080 --> 30:04.680
This arrowhead is poisoned,

30:05.160 --> 30:06.420
and bound with charms.

30:06.890 --> 30:07.680
It is indeed

30:07.680 --> 30:09.810
the only way to fight demons right now.

30:11.050 --> 30:12.700
But if it's truly Taotie,

30:13.590 --> 30:14.920
this is far from enough.

30:18.200 --> 30:19.480
I'm willing to help you

30:20.400 --> 30:21.860
slay the demon and avenge.

30:24.880 --> 30:25.430
Li,

30:26.000 --> 30:27.400
I heard your wife

30:27.920 --> 30:29.350
was killed by Taotie.

30:29.830 --> 30:31.430
Did you witness it yourself?

30:32.680 --> 30:34.160
Could you tell me

30:34.310 --> 30:35.200
the details?

30:37.240 --> 30:38.310
Did you see what it looked like?

30:38.310 --> 30:38.920
Sir,

30:39.640 --> 30:41.550
please don't put Li on the spot.

30:44.960 --> 30:45.490
Leader.

30:46.920 --> 30:49.020
As a Feiyu Guard Demon Slayer...

30:49.310 --> 30:51.110
It's my duty to eliminate demons
for the people.

30:51.110 --> 30:51.960
Yes, of course.

30:51.960 --> 30:53.240
If the demon isn't eliminated,

30:53.240 --> 30:55.680
more people will suffer
the pain of losing loved ones.

30:55.680 --> 30:57.540
Are you going to wait for that day?

31:09.750 --> 31:10.350
Follow me.

31:18.480 --> 31:19.880
My wife's name was Ya'er.

31:21.160 --> 31:22.290
We grew up together.

31:23.310 --> 31:25.310
We were betrothed since childhood.

31:27.190 --> 31:28.920
After marriage, life was hard,

31:29.830 --> 31:32.230
but there was sweetness in the bitterness.

31:34.170 --> 31:35.080
But later,

31:36.350 --> 31:38.550
the government taxes kept increasing,

31:39.510 --> 31:41.570
and I happened to fall seriously ill,

31:42.030 --> 31:43.030
so all our money

31:43.350 --> 31:45.210
was spent on treating my illness.

31:46.960 --> 31:49.200
Tax day was approaching.

31:50.030 --> 31:52.020
I insisted on going hunting
in the mountains despite my illness.

31:52.020 --> 31:53.050
But Ya'er wouldn't allow it.

31:53.050 --> 31:54.450
She absolutely refused.

31:56.030 --> 31:57.360
While I was fast asleep,

31:58.200 --> 32:01.000
she took the bow
and went to the mountains herself.

32:01.610 --> 32:03.090
She was gone for many days.

32:04.830 --> 32:07.230
She returned the day
before taxes were due.

32:08.220 --> 32:09.880
Not only did she bring back game,

32:09.880 --> 32:12.240
she also brought back
a bottle of spring water.

32:12.240 --> 32:13.570
She said that on her way,

32:13.680 --> 32:14.810
she met an immortal,

32:15.070 --> 32:16.330
who gave her a bottle of

32:16.960 --> 32:19.420
Yuli Spring water
that grants immortality.

32:27.590 --> 32:29.190
The water smelled foul to me,

32:29.710 --> 32:31.040
so I refused to drink it.

32:32.110 --> 32:33.770
But Ya'er insisted I drink it.

32:33.920 --> 32:36.190
She said I would be cured
after drinking it.

32:36.190 --> 32:37.390
During our argument,

32:38.510 --> 32:40.040
I accidentally pushed her,

32:41.880 --> 32:43.440
and broke the bottle.

32:45.160 --> 32:46.790
The shards also cut her hand.

32:47.640 --> 32:48.680
I deserve to die.

32:49.750 --> 32:51.410
If I had drunk that water then,

32:52.590 --> 32:54.450
none of this would have happened.

32:56.850 --> 32:57.980
Go play by yourself.

33:00.110 --> 33:01.590
Do you know how to play jianzi?

33:01.590 --> 33:02.270
No, I don't.

33:03.110 --> 33:04.070
I'll teach you.

33:04.720 --> 33:05.790
Don't mess around.

33:06.480 --> 33:08.390
Jianzi is really fun.

33:08.790 --> 33:09.920
I don't want to play.

33:10.910 --> 33:13.260
Just play with me for a while.

33:13.640 --> 33:14.700
Fine. Give it to me.

33:16.680 --> 33:17.940
What's wrong with you?

33:18.200 --> 33:21.400
No need to throw it away
even if you're not playing with me.

33:23.070 --> 33:23.550
Here.

33:23.550 --> 33:24.270
Thank you.

33:24.880 --> 33:25.920
What's your name?

33:26.590 --> 33:27.070
Zixiu.

33:27.160 --> 33:27.790
Zixiu.

33:28.070 --> 33:28.400
Yes.

33:28.720 --> 33:30.720
Do you remember you promised me yesterday

33:30.720 --> 33:32.310
that if I played hide-and-seek with you,

33:32.310 --> 33:33.910
you would tell me something?

33:34.240 --> 33:35.900
Do you know how to play jianzi?

33:36.920 --> 33:37.520
Of course.

33:48.200 --> 33:48.960
That's amazing!

33:48.960 --> 33:49.720
Teach me!

33:50.510 --> 33:51.460
Want to play something else?

33:51.460 --> 33:51.750
Yes.

33:51.750 --> 33:52.280
Let's go.

33:53.750 --> 33:54.640
Later on,

33:56.160 --> 33:57.490
the tax officials came.

33:58.310 --> 33:59.400
They took away our game

33:59.400 --> 34:01.270
and all the valuables in our home.

34:01.510 --> 34:02.680
They still thought it wasn't enough.

34:02.680 --> 34:04.810
Ya'er had to go to the mountains again.

34:06.720 --> 34:08.380
But when she went up this time,

34:10.590 --> 34:11.719
she never came back.

34:13.150 --> 34:15.550
The villagers and I
searched for many days,

34:16.070 --> 34:17.330
but couldn't find her.

34:18.760 --> 34:20.159
We only found her clothes

34:20.710 --> 34:21.360
and...

34:29.280 --> 34:30.610
this half jade pendant.

34:31.400 --> 34:32.929
This is my family heirloom,

34:34.110 --> 34:35.510
our token of love.

34:44.020 --> 34:46.400
At the place
where I found the jade pendant,

34:46.400 --> 34:48.130
I also heard the howl of Taotie,

34:49.070 --> 34:50.550
and saw a pair of eyes.

34:53.480 --> 34:54.550
What kind of eyes?

34:56.000 --> 34:57.320
Blood-red eyes.

34:59.230 --> 35:01.230
Hidden in the forest, staring at me.

35:02.960 --> 35:03.960
If I don't kill it,

35:04.960 --> 35:06.160
I swear I am not human.

35:14.400 --> 35:15.440
Bear with it.

35:15.840 --> 35:17.160
Just cooperate.

35:19.550 --> 35:21.030
You're so nice, Miss,

35:21.150 --> 35:22.710
just like Ya'er.

35:22.840 --> 35:24.030
Who is Ya'er?

35:24.030 --> 35:25.240
She's Li's wife.

35:25.920 --> 35:26.440
Mm-hmm!

35:26.440 --> 35:28.920
Before, only Ya'er would play with me,

35:29.030 --> 35:30.890
sometimes bringing Li along too.

35:31.710 --> 35:32.910
What happened after?

35:33.070 --> 35:35.200
Later, Ya'er disappeared

35:35.320 --> 35:37.230
and Li changed too.

35:37.880 --> 35:38.510
Zixiu.

35:39.190 --> 35:40.110
Was Ya'er

35:40.960 --> 35:42.630
really eaten by Taotie?

35:44.000 --> 35:44.630
No.

35:45.030 --> 35:45.960
But

35:46.400 --> 35:47.840
many people in the village

35:47.840 --> 35:49.310
died in strange ways.

35:49.550 --> 35:50.880
They don't even get coffins—

35:50.880 --> 35:52.070
just wrapped in mats

35:52.070 --> 35:53.670
and thrown in the graveyard.

35:55.510 --> 35:57.510
Follow me if you're not afraid.

35:58.030 --> 35:58.560
Let's go.

36:06.590 --> 36:07.250
We're here.

37:15.670 --> 37:16.440
Li said

37:16.740 --> 37:18.870
at the place where Ya'er disappeared,

37:19.550 --> 37:21.960
he also saw a pair of eyes like these.

37:23.070 --> 37:25.070
Can the dead become a living corpse?

37:29.290 --> 37:30.760
This location is extremely yin,

37:30.760 --> 37:31.820
so it's hard to say.

37:33.810 --> 37:34.740
Don't be afraid.

37:35.430 --> 37:36.690
I'll set up a formation

37:36.820 --> 37:38.420
to suppress the evil energy.

37:42.070 --> 37:42.930
I'm not afraid.

37:54.760 --> 37:56.000
Go and set it up.

38:14.290 --> 38:15.360
Zixiu, come here.

38:15.480 --> 38:15.960
Okay.

38:21.940 --> 38:22.400
Listen,

38:22.400 --> 38:24.800
the rats are gnawing on human bones.

38:38.800 --> 38:40.060
The coins didn't move.

38:40.440 --> 38:42.500
It's likely someone playing tricks.

38:44.970 --> 38:46.710
I have done nothing wrong,

38:47.400 --> 38:49.460
so I'm not afraid of ghosts knocking.

39:08.320 --> 39:09.480
Want to see a magic trick?

39:09.480 --> 39:09.840
Yes.

39:15.150 --> 39:15.880
Blow on it.

39:32.240 --> 39:33.370
Fire!

39:33.510 --> 39:34.280
Hurry!

39:34.280 --> 39:35.480
Come put out the fire!

39:36.320 --> 39:36.840
Leader!

39:37.320 --> 39:38.390
-Leader!
-Leader!

39:38.410 --> 39:39.370
Stomp it out!

39:39.800 --> 39:40.760
That's it!

39:40.760 --> 39:41.840
Quick!

39:41.880 --> 39:42.960
Help!

39:46.630 --> 39:47.440
Harder!

39:47.840 --> 39:49.000
That's it!

39:49.020 --> 39:49.920
Let's go!

39:49.920 --> 39:50.380
Leader.

39:51.690 --> 39:53.090
Are you alright, Leader?

39:53.280 --> 39:54.480
The act fell through.

39:55.230 --> 39:55.670
Sir...

39:55.920 --> 39:56.940
S-Sir...

39:57.510 --> 39:59.280
You have such nerve,

39:59.480 --> 40:01.280
daring to trick the Feiyu Guard.

40:02.480 --> 40:02.960
No.

40:03.070 --> 40:04.000
Sir, let me explain.

40:04.000 --> 40:06.150
Mount Qiansui has always been barren,

40:06.550 --> 40:08.760
we truly cannot afford the taxes.

40:09.410 --> 40:10.510
We had no choice

40:10.920 --> 40:13.630
but to spread rumors
about monsters hurting people

40:13.630 --> 40:15.150
and destroying fields and homes.

40:15.150 --> 40:18.590
Our goal was to keep officials
and outsiders away

40:18.590 --> 40:21.230
so we could have a moment to breathe.

40:22.000 --> 40:24.000
We dressed as ghosts to scare people

40:24.030 --> 40:25.160
out of desperation,

40:25.630 --> 40:27.490
with no intention to harm anyone.

40:27.590 --> 40:29.960
Please understand our situation, Sir.

40:30.150 --> 40:31.070
Please be merciful, Sir!

40:31.070 --> 40:31.920
Please be merciful.

40:31.920 --> 40:33.150
Since we entered the village,

40:33.150 --> 40:34.150
we've been telling you

40:34.150 --> 40:35.760
we're not here to collect money

40:35.760 --> 40:37.150
but to capture monsters.

40:37.150 --> 40:38.880
Yet you still try to deceive us.

40:39.070 --> 40:40.230
I... I... I...

40:40.550 --> 40:41.550
I had no choice.

40:41.670 --> 40:42.600
Well... Well...

40:44.400 --> 40:47.030
I was once forced into
doing something like this too.

40:47.030 --> 40:48.630
Though they have deceived us,

40:48.630 --> 40:50.510
they truly haven't hurt anyone.

40:57.670 --> 40:58.280
Get up.

40:58.550 --> 40:59.280
Thank you, Sir.

40:59.280 --> 40:59.760
Thank you, Sir!

40:59.760 --> 41:00.320
Thank you, Sir.

41:00.320 --> 41:00.880
Thank you, Sir.

41:00.880 --> 41:02.340
Was Taotie from last night

41:02.360 --> 41:04.160
also something you fabricated?

41:04.510 --> 41:05.030
My Lord,

41:05.320 --> 41:07.400
there really are monsters here.

41:07.920 --> 41:10.760
Strange incidents
have occurred in the village.

41:11.110 --> 41:12.640
Every time officials came,

41:12.670 --> 41:14.320
they claimed
they would eliminate the monsters,

41:14.320 --> 41:15.780
but they would always fail

41:15.880 --> 41:17.000
and only add to the extortion—

41:17.000 --> 41:17.320
Even so—

41:17.320 --> 41:18.850
I'll say this one last time.

41:19.630 --> 41:21.510
The two of us came here

41:21.510 --> 41:22.910
with no ulterior motive.

41:29.320 --> 41:30.320
Only here to eliminate monsters.

41:30.320 --> 41:30.710
Yes.

41:31.710 --> 41:33.320
Then we're extremely grateful, Sir.

41:33.320 --> 41:34.110
Thank you, Sir.

41:34.110 --> 41:34.800
Thank you, Sir.

41:34.800 --> 41:36.840
But you must tell me everything

41:37.110 --> 41:39.190
that has happened here in detail.

41:39.190 --> 41:39.590
Us.

41:39.590 --> 41:40.120
Do not...

41:41.400 --> 41:43.440
hide anything.

41:45.710 --> 41:47.760
I wouldn't dare deceive you at all.
